  "notes": "{陶酔|とうすい} contains ⟦{陶|とう}→陶：noentry⟧ (pottery/to mold) and ⟦{酔|すい}→酔：noentry⟧ (drunk), suggesting being shaped or molded by the experience of intoxication.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {陶酔|とうすい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to be intoxicated, to be enraptured\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{陶酔|とうすい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to be intoxicated by ~\n- ⟦{自己|じこ}→自己：23357_jiko⟧{陶酔|とうすい}: self-intoxication, narcissism\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{酔|よ}う→酔う：14437_you⟧: to get drunk (more literal)\n- ⟦{恍惚|こうこつ}→恍惚：06002_koukotsu⟧: ecstasy (more intense)\n- ⟦{夢中|むちゅう}→夢中：03752_muchuu⟧: absorbed in (less intense)",
